<body>
    <h1>Sub-Advisor Review</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <div role=3D"region" aria-label=3D"Info" class=3D"confluence-inform=
ation-macro  confluence-information-macro-information">
 <p class=3D"title conf-macro-render">Overview</p>
 <span role=3D"presentation" class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-=
info-filled confluence-information-macro-icon"></span>
 <div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
  <p><strong>Purpose</strong>
   <br>
   This outreach validates sub=E2=80=91advisor relationships and firm hiera=
rchy data with RVPs to ensure intentional, auditable decisions.&nbsp;&nbsp;=
</p>
  <p><strong>Why this matters</strong>
   <br>
   =E2=80=A2 No system=E2=80=91level sub=E2=80=91advisor identifier exists =
today
   <br>
   =E2=80=A2 Parent / group changes carry downstream access and reporting r=
isk
   <br>
   =E2=80=A2 Business=E2=80=91validated requirements are required for Compa=
ss access and role design</p>
 </div>
</div>
<div class=3D"panel" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
 <div class=3D"panelHeader" style=3D"border-bottom-width: 1px;">
  <b>Intended Outcomes</b>
 </div>
 <div class=3D"panelContent">
  <p>=E2=80=A2 Business=E2=80=91confirmed list of sub=E2=80=91advisor relat=
ionships
   <br>
   =E2=80=A2 Documented sub=E2=80=91advisor access and usage requirements&n=
bsp;
   <br>
   =E2=80=A2 Clear audit trail of decisions and follow=E2=80=91ups</p>
 </div>
</div>
<div class=3D"panel" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
 <div class=3D"panelHeader" style=3D"border-bottom-width: 1px;">
  <b>Why RVP Confirmation is required</b>
 </div>
 <div class=3D"panelContent">
  <p>=E2=80=A2 Currently there is no sub-advisor identifier, therefore the =
data needs business confirmation.&nbsp;
   <br>
   =E2=80=A2 RVPs have the appropriate insight into their clients requireme=
nts</p>
 </div>
</div>
<div class=3D"panel" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
 <div class=3D"panelHeader" style=3D"border-bottom-width: 1px;">
  <b>Engagement Model</b>
 </div>
 <div class=3D"panelContent">
  <p><strong>Primary:&nbsp; 1:1 RVP review</strong></p>
  <p><strong>Objective:</strong> Review Compass legacy data analysis at a h=
igh level</p>
  <p><strong>Meeting 1: Agenda</strong></p>
  <ol>
   <li data-uuid=3D"0b543300-1ae3-4bca-830e-c62a5d6ffdfe">Context: what=E2=
=80=99s coming and why this review is required</li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"5fbb3599-46d5-47f5-94f2-fdcb5d0b4cde">Review methodolog=
y used to flag potential sub=E2=80=91advisor firms</li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"81081f08-9cb2-4cbd-8a07-b96566579f32">Confirm flagged r=
elationships</li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"677fcab7-0fb3-4c6c-9457-ee2a6e6edc38">Capture suggested=
 firms for discovery and pilot&nbsp;</li>
  </ol>
  <p><strong>Meeting 2:</strong></p>
  <ol>
   <li data-uuid=3D"5c16ec4b-bddb-4f32-a159-c94cb176a130">Review methodolog=
y used to flag potential sub=E2=80=91advisor firms</li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"2e470a0d-ed05-437a-beed-6cc493edf3d9">Review data inclu=
ding SZ/NetRep&nbsp;</li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"ecb7b15f-dbcf-406e-9d32-7d3941e65f53">Validate proposed=
 F360 parent / group changes (TBD)</li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"59ef323e-dec6-49bf-b9aa-db4b3c6c7238">Capture sub=E2=80=
=91advisor access and usage requirements (TBD)</li>
  </ol>
  <p><strong>Secondary:&nbsp; RVP Roundtable&nbsp;</strong></p>
  <p><strong>Purpose</strong>
   <br>
   Share consolidated findings and align on standard handling going forward=
.</p>
  <p><strong>Proposed Agenda</strong></p>
  <ul>
   <li data-uuid=3D"ae7a05a5-81a0-47eb-b835-83c0d1f016b1">Why this exercise=
 was required</li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"5509dc52-8e27-4caa-a208-a0a25cea528e">Summary of confir=
med findings and patterns</li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"97685c60-8ec1-4adf-93be-0231fcb6d9c4">Expected changes =
to come</li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"055cdfdb-6f94-4cc9-bc53-68e866313573">Old vs. new handl=
ing&nbsp;</li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"e71b1354-dc4d-4c75-8f22-9fb12c9271ba">Benefits and risk=
 reduction</li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"bbef7688-f0aa-4210-89b4-5163310ccdb3">Q&amp;A and next =
steps</li>
  </ul>
 </div>
</div>
<div class=3D"panel" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
 <div class=3D"panelHeader" style=3D"border-bottom-width: 1px;">
  <b>Pre=E2=80=91Work Package </b>
 </div>
 <div class=3D"panelContent">
  <p>To ensure we are optimizing all parties time, prior to the meeting the=
 RVP will receive a communication that includes:</p>
  <ul>
   <li data-uuid=3D"e348d06d-435b-45ef-b2e8-d1e1f1f7a3d7">Meeting invite</l=
i>
   <li data-uuid=3D"4876b860-9b2d-429c-8c46-d20cff3e440d">Meeting agenda</l=
i>
   <li data-uuid=3D"3d6e6283-1757-45a7-8d40-ae33e98b9b66">Ask to complete s=
ome pre-work with instructions</li>
  </ul>
  <p>The attachments will include a spreadsheet with the following informat=
ion if applicable:</p>
  <ul>
   <li data-uuid=3D"9836a2a9-5639-48b0-b0e3-ba8a85163cb4">Sub=E2=80=91Advis=
or Relationship Review</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
   <br>
  </p>
 </div>
</div>
<div class=3D"panel" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
 <div class=3D"panelHeader" style=3D"border-bottom-width: 1px;">
  <b>Sub-Advisor Access and Usage Discovery</b>
 </div>
 <div class=3D"panelContent">
  <p>To help us understand the requirements of Sub=E2=80=91Advisors, the se=
cond 1:1 session will include dedicated time for discovery. The objective o=
f this discussion is to gather business input from RVPs to enable us to:</p=
>
  <ul>
   <li data-uuid=3D"bce6658b-befa-44c7-ab0c-bda62478ad16">Identify common S=
ub=E2=80=91Advisor operating models across segments</li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"064ce29d-9ad6-4d4c-8085-8ba5ad52d613">Inform future rol=
e=E2=80=91based access patterns for Compass and related systems</li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"685371d7-c1d5-43eb-a962-1d6f3c8550eb">Ensure future acc=
ess decisions align with business reality and risk controls</li>
  </ul>
  <p>This discovery is intended to capture how Sub=E2=80=91Advisor relation=
ships operate today, not to approve or implement access changes as part of =
this exercise. Inputs will be reviewed and analyzed in aggregate to inform =
future design and governance decisions.</p>
  <p><strong>Suggested Discovery Questions</strong></p>
  <p>The questions below are intended as conversation guides, not a checkli=
st. Responses should reflect typical practices and meaningful variations.</=
p>
  <ul>
   <li data-uuid=3D"e0e637ae-c22f-486a-89c8-4b87433350e2">How does the PM t=
ypically interact with the assigned Sub=E2=80=91Advisor?</li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"85986b8d-df0f-4774-921b-152a2b113f09">What systems does=
 the Sub=E2=80=91Advisor require access to in order to perform their role?<=
/li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"6b9d3ad4-a198-4965-a0c6-5cc50470c04b">Are there differe=
nt usage or access profiles depending on the type of sub=E2=80=91advisory r=
elationship?</li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"a90a26b9-0652-40af-a2f8-5ba43ae034b5">What are the typi=
cal duties performed by the Sub=E2=80=91Advisor (e.g., trading, reporting, =
oversight)?</li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"17ea9b54-1f13-41b5-921c-a87cf199b214">When and where do=
 Sub=E2=80=91Advisors primarily operate (e.g., NetRep, Compass, SecureZone)=
?</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Insights will be tracked in Aha! (link)</p>
 </div>
</div>
<div class=3D"panel" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
 <div class=3D"panelHeader" style=3D"border-bottom-width: 1px;">
  <b>Decision Framwork</b>
 </div>
 <div class=3D"panelContent">
  <p>
   <br>
  </p>
  <div class=3D"table-wrap">
   <table class=3D"wrapped relative-table confluenceTable" style=3D"width: =
34.8051%;">
    <colgroup>
     <col style=3D"width: 50.679%;">
     <col style=3D"width: 49.3134%;">
    </colgroup>
    <tbody>
     <tr>
      <td class=3D"highlight-#b3d4ff confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D=
"#b3d4ff"><strong title=3D"">Decision</strong></td>
      <td class=3D"highlight-#b3d4ff confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D=
"#b3d4ff"><strong title=3D"">Action</strong></td>
     </tr>
     <tr>
      <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Confirmed by RVP</td>
      <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Treated as validated - Flag with indicator=
</td>
     </tr>
     <tr>
      <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Confirmed not a Sub-Advisor</td>
      <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Logged for further investigation</td>
     </tr>
     <tr>
      <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Unsure/No Confirmation</td>
      <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Logged for further investigation</td>
     </tr>
     <tr>
      <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Parent Name confirmed as correct&nbsp;</td=
>
      <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Treated as validated</td>
     </tr>
     <tr>
      <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Parent Name confirmed as not correct</td>
      <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Submit for correction</td>
     </tr>
    </tbody>
   </table>
  </div>
  <p>All confirmations and notes are retained in the master spreadsheet to =
maintain an audit trail.</p>
 </div>
</div>
<div class=3D"panel" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
 <div class=3D"panelHeader" style=3D"border-bottom-width: 1px;">
  <b>Outcomes</b>
 </div>
 <div class=3D"panelContent">
  <div class=3D"table-wrap">
   <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width: =
44.8544%;">
    <colgroup>
     <col style=3D"width: 49.914%;">
     <col style=3D"width: 50.0162%;">
    </colgroup>
    <tbody>
     <tr>
      <th class=3D"highlight-#b3d4ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D=
"#b3d4ff" scope=3D"col">Result</th>
      <th class=3D"highlight-#b3d4ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D=
"#b3d4ff" scope=3D"col">Metric</th>
     </tr>
     <tr>
      <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Firms Sub Advisor relationships confirmed<=
/td>
      <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
       <br>
      </td>
     </tr>
     <tr>
      <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Parent Group issues resolved</td>
      <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
       <br>
      </td>
     </tr>
     <tr>
      <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Items requiring follow up</td>
      <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
       <br>
      </td>
     </tr>
     <tr>
      <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Readiness to proceed to next phase</td>
      <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
       <br>
      </td>
     </tr>
    </tbody>
   </table>
  </div>
 </div>
</div>
<p>
 <br>
</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
